                    <div class="abstract">&lt;p id=&quot;isPasted&quot;&gt;Federal Facilities Research and Development Survey: Fiscal Year 2025&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;These data tables are from the FY 2025 Federal Facilities Research and Development (FFRD) Survey. These tables present data on research and experimental development (R&amp;amp;D) expenditures for all federally owned and operated facilities in the United States. This survey is the unique source of federal performer-reported data on R&amp;amp;D expenditures and is conducted by the National Center for Science and Engineering Statistics within the U.S. National Science Foundation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</div>
