 experimental development), cost categories (salaries, software, equipment, and indirect costs), and trends over time. The HERD Survey is conducted by the National Center for Science and Engineering Statistics within the National Science Foundation.&quot;,&quot;pubType&quot;:null,&quot;publishDate&quot;:&quot;12/15/2022&quot;,&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;nsf23304&quot;,&quot;slugifiedNumber&quot;:&quot;nsf23304&quot;,&quot;sortDate&quot;:&quot;2022.12.15&quot;,&quot;survey&quot;:[&quot;Higher Education Research and Development (HERD) Survey&quot;],&quot;surveyDTO&quot;:[{&quot;active&quot;:true,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Higher Education Research and Development (HERD) Survey&quot;}],&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Higher Education Research and Development: Fiscal Year 2021&quot;,&quot;topics&quot;:[&quot;Business R&amp;D&quot;,&quot;By Country&quot;,&quot;By State or Region&quot;,&quot;Clinical Trials and Medical Projects&quot;,&quot;Federal Government/Agency R&amp;D&quot;,&quot;Fields of Study&quot;,&quot;Higher Education Degrees&quot;,&quot;Higher Education Enrollment&quot;,&quot;Higher Education R&amp;D&quot;,&quot;Institutions&quot;,&quot;Minorities in Higher Education&quot;,&quot;Nonprofit R&amp;D&quot;,&quot;Race and Ethnicity&quot;,&quot;R&amp;D Capital Expenditures&quot;,&quot;R&amp;D Cost Type&quot;,&quot;R&amp;D Employment&quot;,&quot;R&amp;D Funding Agreement (contract, grant, reimbursement, etc.)&quot;,&quot;R&amp;D Funding by Government&quot;,&quot;R&amp;D Funding Source&quot;,&quot;Skilled Technical Workforce&quot;,&quot;State Government/Agency R&amp;D&quot;,&quot;Type of R&amp;D (basic, applied, experimental development)&quot;],&quot;year&quot;:&quot;2022&quot;},{&quot;aois&quot;:[&quot;Research and Development Funding and Performance&quot;],&quot;archived&quot;:false,&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;Data Tables&quot;,&quot;dataCollection&quot;:[],&quot;dataCollectionDTO&quot;:[],&quot;id&quot;:2965,&quot;number&quot;:&quot;NSF 23-309&quot;,&quot;pubAbstract&quot;:&quot