Private Nonprofit Institutions Totaled $8.3 Billion in FY 2019&quot;,&quot;topics&quot;:[&quot;By Country&quot;,&quot;By State or Region&quot;,&quot;Citizenship&quot;,&quot;Faculty Rank, Tenure Status&quot;,&quot;Federal Government/Agency R&amp;D&quot;,&quot;Financial Support&quot;,&quot;Higher Education Degrees&quot;,&quot;Higher Education Enrollment&quot;,&quot;Higher Education R&amp;D&quot;,&quot;Institutions&quot;,&quot;New Construction&quot;,&quot;Nonprofit R&amp;D&quot;,&quot;R&amp;D Employment&quot;,&quot;R&amp;D Funding by Government&quot;,&quot;R&amp;D Funding Source&quot;,&quot;Repairs and Renovations&quot;,&quot;Sex&quot;,&quot;State Government R&amp;D-related Facilities&quot;,&quot;Student Loan Debt&quot;,&quot;Type of R&amp;D (basic, applied, experimental development)&quot;],&quot;year&quot;:&quot;2021&quot;},{&quot;aois&quot;:[&quot;Research and Development Funding and Performance&quot;],&quot;archived&quot;:false,&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;Reports&quot;,&quot;dataCollection&quot;:[&quot;Science and Engineering Indicators&quot;],&quot;dataCollectionDTO&quot;:[{&quot;active&quot;:true,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Science and Engineering Indicators&quot;}],&quot;id&quot;:1644,&quot;number&quot;:&quot;NSB-2021-4&quot;,&quot;pubAbstract&quot;:&quot;This report presents data on conference proceedings and peer-reviewed science and engineering journals that reflect the expanding volume of research activity, the involvement and scientific capabilities of different countries, and the growing research ecosystem demonstrated through international collaborations. Publication output grew 5% over the past 4 years, led by China and other middle-income countries. Internationally collaborative research increased in 2020 with nearly one in four articles having coauthors from multiple countries.&quot;,&quot;pubType&quot;:null,&quot;publishDate&quot;:&quot;10/28/2021&quot;,&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;nsb20214&quot;,&quot;slugifiedNumber&quot;:&quot;nsb20214&quot;,&quot;sortDate&