ive information about U.S. science, engineering, and technology. Chapters focus on science and mathematics in elementary and secondary education; S&amp;E higher education; the S&amp;E workforce; R&amp;D funding and alliances; academic R&amp;D; industry, technology, and the global marketplace; public attitudes toward and understanding of science and technology; and the significance of information technology. International comparisons are included. A separate appendix volume contains detailed statistical tables. &quot;,&quot;pubType&quot;:null,&quot;publishDate&quot;:&quot;04/01/2002&quot;,&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;https://www.nsf.gov/statistics/seind02/&quot;,&quot;slugifiedNumber&quot;:&quot;nsb021&quot;,&quot;sortDate&quot;:&quot;2002.04.01&quot;,&quot;survey&quot;:[],&quot;surveyDTO&quot;:[],&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Science and Engineering Indicators - 2002&quot;,&quot;topics&quot;:[],&quot;year&quot;:&quot;2002&quot;},{&quot;aois&quot;:[],&quot;archived&quot;:true,&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;Reference&quot;,&quot;dataCollection&quot;:[&quot;Master Government List of Federally Funded R&amp;D Centers&quot;],&quot;dataCollectionDTO&quot;:[{&quot;active&quot;:false,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Master Government List of Federally Funded R&amp;D Centers&quot;}],&quot;id&quot;:1057,&quot;number&quot;:&quot;NSF 02-317&quot;,&quot;pubAbstract&quot;:&quot;Federally Funded Research and Development Centers&quot;,&quot;pubType&quot;:null,&quot;publishDate&quot;:&quot;03/24/2002&quot;,&quot;slug&quot;:&quot;https://ncses.nsf.gov/resource/master-gov-lists-ffrdc/prior-lists#card3454&quot;,&quot;slugifiedNumber&quot;:&quot;nsf02317&quot;,&quot;sortDate&quot;:&quot;2002.03.24&quot;,&quot;survey&quot;:[],&quot;surveyDTO&quot;:[],&quot;title&quot;:&quot;Annotated List of 36 Federally Funded R&amp;D Centers (FFRDCs): FY 2002&quot;,&quot;topics&quot;:[],&quot;year&quot;:&quot;2002&quot;},{&quot;aois&quot;:[],&quot;archived&quot;:true,&quot;contentType&quot;:&quot;InfoBrief&quot;,&quot;dataCo